'' 'override' in a generic nothing instantiates is not checked; in one that is
'' instantiated it is. Measured on fbc-modern: an unused template overriding nothing is
'' silent, and the same template instantiated is error 223 "in instantiation of ...".
'' tiko refused every 'override' in an unused generic, which kept seven of fbc's ten
'' tui tests from compiling at all -- see the source.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/override-unused-generic.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: error TKO0621: 'nope' is marked 'override' but overrides no virtual method
'' EXPECT-NOT: 'paint' is marked
'' EXPECT-NOT: 'size' is marked
'' EXPECT-NOT: 'ghost' is marked
